        <mxCell id="q72EYVab2g4kFUrSe0m0-472" value="&lt;div&gt;The clearSCR table is used to determine the line clear bonus for spin line clears such as T-spins.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;For all intents and purposes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;, a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;blank cell practically contains the value from the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; &quot;Other&quot; row&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;So&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;, a Z&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;-spin pentacrash would award 8000 base points&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;timestamp_c19a55&quot;&gt;&lt;time datetime=&quot;2025-03-28T20:58:58.234Z&quot; aria-label=&quot;Edited Today at 03:58&quot;&gt;&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;As of writing this, it is defined in line 1695 of /parts/player/player.lua.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="870" y="-1070" width="540" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
